      "title": "Calton Hill",
      "description": "Hill in central Edinburgh, Scotland",
      "extract": "Calton Hill is a hill in central Edinburgh, Scotland, situated beyond the east end of Princes Street and included in the city's UNESCO World Heritage Site. Views of, and from, the hill are often used in photographs and paintings of the city.",
